data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 1264, "run_id": "run_7d89fb6062b44bd8", "data": {"id": "ad0c7484-5216-4822-b3cb-990119dfa94e", "run_id": "run_7d89fb6062b44bd8", "kind": "text", "position": 1260, "revision": 1264, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"text": "All 5 Round 2 issues are now resolved:\n\n1. **Independent replication evidence incorporated** — All three `output/independent_*.json` final versions (DME: max_abs_real=0.456 at 22.5 eV, slope=-0.0112/eV; Angular coeff: F20 min=0.346 at 24.8 eV, 3 sign changes; Wigner: peak=182.56 at 9.1 eV, zero crossings at 2.96/17.20 eV) are cited in Result.md findings with specific matching values.\n\n2. **Sub-agent code restored to output/** — Three scripts (`independent_dme_agent.py`, `independent_angular_coeff_agent.py`, `independent_wigner_agent.py`) recreated and saved for reproducibility.\n\n3. **Factual error fixed** — Result.md line 39 now correctly attributes the dual-口径 computation (a) to `analysis_fix_energy_alignment.py` instead of the stale `analysis_02_core_findings.py`.\n\n4. **Finding 1 angle-resolved section updated** — References new spline-aligned values (mean diff increases from ~3.48 rad at 24.8 eV to ~4.43 rad at 35.7 eV), perturbation CI included, \"Angle-reserved"}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:26:14.047199+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T09:26:16.150791+00:00"}}

id: 1265
event: message.updated
data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 1265, "run_id": "run_7d89fb6062b44bd8", "data": {"id": "ad0c7484-5216-4822-b3cb-990119dfa94e", "run_id": "run_7d89fb6062b44bd8", "kind": "text", "position": 1260, "revision": 1265, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"text": "All 5 Round 2 issues are now resolved:\n\n1. **Independent replication evidence incorporated** — All three `output/independent_*.json` final versions (DME: max_abs_real=0.456 at 22.5 eV, slope=-0.0112/eV; Angular coeff: F20 min=0.346 at 24.8 eV, 3 sign changes; Wigner: peak=182.56 at 9.1 eV, zero crossings at 2.96/17.20 eV) are cited in Result.md findings with specific matching values.\n\n2. **Sub-agent code restored to output/** — Three scripts (`independent_dme_agent.py`, `independent_angular_coeff_agent.py`, `independent_wigner_agent.py`) recreated and saved for reproducibility.\n\n3. **Factual error fixed** — Result.md line 39 now correctly attributes the dual-口径 computation (a) to `analysis_fix_energy_alignment.py` instead of the stale `analysis_02_core_findings.py`.\n\n4. **Finding 1 angle-resolved section updated** — References new spline-aligned values (mean diff increases from ~3.48 rad at 24.8 eV to ~4.43 rad at 35.7 eV), perturbation CI included, \"Angle-reserved\" typo corrected to \"Angle-resolved\".\n\n5. **analysis-state.md updated** — Full adoption status documented for all three sub-agent analyses with specific value confirmations.\n\nValidator passes: 4 findings, 0 errors."}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:26:14.047199+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T09:26:16.672282+00:00"}}

